# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 非遗食谱 AI — Environment Variables
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your API keys:
#   cp .env.local.example .env.local
#
# Without any keys, the app still works using built-in mock recipes
# and Pollinations.ai free image generation.

# ─── Text Generation ───────────────────────────────────────────

# Tencent Hunyuan (混元大模型) API key
# Get yours at: https://console.cloud.tencent.com/hunyuan
# The API is OpenAI-compatible — this route uses the /chat/completions endpoint.
# Model: hunyuan-turbo (fast, cost-effective)
#
# If you use Tencent Yuanqi (元器) instead, change TENCENT_HUNYUAN_BASE_URL
# to your Yuanqi knowledge-base endpoint.
TENCENT_HUNYUAN_API_KEY=

# (Optional) Override the default Hunyuan base URL.
# Default: https://api.hunyuan.cloud.tencent.com/v1
# For Yuanqi (元器): https://your-yuanqi-endpoint/v1
# TENCENT_HUNYUAN_BASE_URL=

# ─── Image Generation (Optional) ────────────────────────────────

# SiliconFlow API key — free tier gives 100 images/day
# Get yours at: https://siliconflow.cn (注册即送免费额度)
# Used as a fallback when Pollinations.ai is slow.
# If left empty, only Pollinations.ai is used (always free, no key needed).
# SILICONFLOW_API_KEY=
